@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9">
            <div class="bg-white p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4 shadow-sm border border-light">
                <span class="badge bg-primary-subtle text-primary border border-primary-subtle px-3 py-2 rounded-pill fw-semibold mb-2">Legal &amp; Trust</span>
                <h2 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-4">Privacy Policy &amp; Data Security</h2>

                <p class="text-secondary">
                    Welcome to <strong>RentHaven</strong> (House Rental Management System). We are committed to protecting the privacy, identity, and personal credentials of tenants and property landlords across our digital rental ecosystem.
                </p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">
                    When you register an account, list a property, or submit a rental application, we collect essential identity details including your full name, email address, contact telephone, occupational status, verified income brackets, and property specifications.
                </p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">2. How Information is Used</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">
                    Information provided in rental applications is made visible solely to the designated landlord of the applied property for the explicit purpose of tenancy evaluation. Your contact credentials are never sold or shared with unsolicited third-party advertising networks.
                </p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-2">3. Role-Based Access Controls</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">
                    We enforce strict role-based access controls (RBAC) backed by ASP.NET Core Identity. Landlords can only modify or review properties and applications that belong directly to their registered profile, while administrative staff oversee platform integrity and moderation.
                </p>

                <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span class="small text-muted">Last Updated: October 2026</span>
                    <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i> Return Home</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
